  "boundaries": [
    "All attachment entries require a persistent native SQLite connection with synchronous transaction support, journaling, synchronous >= NORMAL, foreign keys enabled. sql.js, volatile DBs and missing transaction wrappers are explicitly unsupported.",
    "Actual SIGKILL worker tests cover four WAL commit boundary states and integrity_check. Power failure, arbitrary multi-process races and production SQLCipher were not tested.",
    "File source stability uses bounded fd reads, lstat/realpath, hardlink count and identity/timestamp checks. No claim of complete resistance to same-OS-user malicious Windows reparse races.",
    "No persistent disk attachment copy or source path is created. Metadata, BLOB and activity commit atomically. Legacy file_path rows are not opened, imported or unlinked.",
    "Strict bounded text is rendered through Vue interpolation; other bytes require explicit download using octet-stream Blob. Exported files cannot be remotely revoked.",
    "Native tests execute actual production DDL, managers, IPC and preload with injected window/identity/picker boundaries. Renderer uses actual Vue/Pinia plus shell/IPC/router substitutes. No real Electron GUI or full production build validation.",
    "Four uncontrolled whole-vault transfers now fail closed; valid context switches and main-process managed backups remain. Authenticated native whole-vault import/export/migration and a general database authorization overhaul remain pending.",
    "Object-specific grants, approvals, version CAS, durable action idempotency/ActionRun, canonical adjuncts, real model outbound integration and external business/release acceptance remain pending.",
    "One initial native test expected journal_mode=OFF to take effect; SQLite defensive mode ignored the setting. The test now disables synchronous and checks the actual safety gate. The original failed log is preserved separately; final matrices rerun.",
    "Uncommitted and unpublished. Previous batch 15/16/17 evidence is preserved; unrelated concurrent CLI/IDE/session-core/RRSI work is excluded."
  ],
